{"scenario": "hooks/lock-turns-subscribed-kinds-into-asks", "requires": ["v1", "test-hooks"], "doc": "[C] With a before-tool rule on `execute`, a Claude session's lock carries the managed ask rule for Bash (so even a step Claude would allow itself reaches the seam), never an allow rule, and the session's snapshot says which kinds are hooked. Whether Claude Code's ask rule makes read-only commands ask is expected, unverified: this mock row is its only proof until the combined live run."}
{"do": "root"}
{"do": "sqlite", "path": "$DATA/work.db", "sql_file": "$SCENARIOS/../fixtures/work-db-6.sql"}
{"do": "run", "bin": "/bin/sh", "args": ["-c", "mkdir -p $ROOT/work"], "expect_code": 0}
{"do": "write_file", "path": "$CONFIG/settings.el", "mode": "600", "text": "(drgnx-settings :version 1 (drgnx-agents-profiles ((\"mock-claude\" :provider claude :command (\"$MOCK\" \"acp\" \"--as\" \"claude\" \"--log\" \"$ROOT/acp.log\")))))\n"}
{"do": "start", "hub": "h"}
{"do": "connect", "conn": "c", "hub": "h"}
{"do": "send", "conn": "c", "json": {"id": 1, "method": "config/settings", "params": {"overrides": [{"name": "drgnx-agents-hook-rules", "source": "row", "value": [{"point": "before-tool", "tool-kinds": ["execute"], "command": "^rm ", "verdict": "deny", "reason": "no rm"}]}]}}}
{"do": "expect", "conn": "c", "json": {"id": 1, "result": {"applied": 1}}, "within_ms": 10000}
{"do": "send", "conn": "c", "json": {"id": 2, "method": "agents/start", "params": {"profile": "mock-claude", "cwd": "$ROOT/work", "role": "worker"}}}
{"do": "expect", "conn": "c", "json": {"id": 2, "result": {"id": "$capture:sid", "name": "$string"}}, "within_ms": 30000}
{"do": "file", "path": "$ROOT/acp.log", "contains": "\"ask\":[\"Bash\",\"BashOutput\",\"KillShell\"]", "within_ms": 15000}
{"do": "file_grep", "paths": ["$ROOT/acp.log"], "absent": "\"allow\":["}
{"do": "send", "conn": "c", "json": {"id": 3, "method": "agents/get", "params": {"id": "$sid"}}}
{"do": "expect", "conn": "c", "json": {"id": 3, "result": {"session": {"id": "$sid", "hooked": {"before_tool": ["execute"], "by_adapter": [], "unhooked": []}}}}, "within_ms": 10000}
